    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFirst floor 2 bedroom apartment in an exclusive development located just off the N11.\n\n**Parking Included**\n\nThe Elms is a first floor fully furnished apartment which has recently been upgraded with a newly fitted kitchen and shower room.\n\nThe accommodation is spacious and bright and briefly comprises; living/Dining room with sliding doors to Balcony, newly fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms and shower room. \n\nThe Elms is an exclusive development located just off the N11, set in mature landscaped gardens. The development is gated with onsite security and is within a leisurely stroll of the seafront in Blackrock and also the wide range of shops and eateries of the village. \n\nThere are also numerous shopping centres in close proximity including Blackrock and Stillorgan. The N11 (QBC) with various bus routes and the Blackrock Dart Station all provide easy access to the City Centre."
